  << /ActualText (Digital Creative Designer \046 CS\054 B2B Startup\054 Broadcust 2024\0552026\nIdentified user friction points on the platform and collaborated with the development team to improve the user experience\056\nWorked directly with business clients through onboarding and training\054 translating their needs and feedback into product insights\056\nDesigned responsive digital content for clients\072 concepts\054 landing pages\054 and brand sites\054 optimized for mobile and desktop\054 using AI\056\n\nMedia Relations Manager\054 Comms \046 PR\054 H\046M\054 2020\0552022\nLed user research\054 focus groups\054 and market trend analysis to understand target audiences and their behavior patterns\056\nShaped communication messages for different brand categories and diverse target audiences\054 keeping brand identity\054 tone\054 and messaging consistent\056\n\nIWR \050Indoor Window Responsibility\051\054 H\046M 2019\0552020\nPlanned and built nationwide visual displays for stores and windows across all departments\054 aligned with business goals and brand identity and adapted to seasonality\054 holidays and local audiences\056\nCollaborated cross\055functionally to implement commercial concepts in stores\054 tracking guideline execution and making adjustments as needed\056\n\nVM \050Visual Merchandiser\051\054 H\046M 2016\0552019\nAnalyzed customer behavior and movement patterns\054 translating insights into layout and display optimization\056\nBuilt visual displays for departments and windows to create a consistent\054 customer focused shopping experience\056\n\nC\046D \050Communication \046 Design\051\054 IKEA 2012\0552015\nShaped the in\055store customer experience through visual hierarchy\054 navigation and product presentation to guide clear\054 confident decision\055making\056\nTranslated business goals and sales KPIs into practical visual solutions while maintaining a consistent customer experience\056)
     /K [ 12 ]
